stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Free: no holder
  Free --> Held: acquire (generation + 1, holder = actor, connection, engine owner, epoch)
  Held --> Held: acquire conflict or replayed acquire returns original receipt
  Held --> Free: explicit release (generation kept)
  Held --> Stale: engine restart or holder process lost (old tokens invalid)
  Stale --> Free: explicit recovery (tasks not resumed)
  note right of Held
    Opaque host-local token checked against
    holder, generation, connection, actor,
    scope and engine owner
  end note
